$ render workspace set --help
stdout:
Render CLI v2.15.1
Set the CLI's active workspace
USAGE
  render workspace set [workspaceName|workspaceID] [flags]
FLAGS
  -h, --help              help for set
      --confirm           Skip all confirmation prompts
  -o, --output <FORMAT>   Output format: interactive, json, yaml, or text (auto: text in non-TTY contexts unless explicitly set) (default "interactive")
DETAILS
Set the CLI's active workspace. All CLI commands run against the active
workspace.
	The active workspace is saved in a config file specified by the RENDER_CLI_CONFIG_PATH environment variable.
	If unspecified, the config file is saved in $HOME/.render/cli.yaml.
exit code 0
